a link from its description","why":"11 list items open with a link and then explain it, all at the same weight — so the thing you can click is no easier to find than the sentence about it. The link becomes the item and the explanation sits under it.","value":"11 items"},{"id":"banner-graphic","on":true,"label":"Retire the old banner graphic","why":"It repeats the page title in picture form, which the new banner already does in type.","removes":"Unorganized Territory - Policies for Schools Banner.png"},{"id":"capheadings","on":true,"label":"Bring every heading up to h3 or above","why":"2 headings sat at h4 or deeper inside a card, a callout, a contact block or an accordion panel — components the outline walk leaves alone because they label a thing rather than a section. A reader using a screen reader still hears the level, so a fourth-level title inside a page that only goes to three is announced as belonging to a level that does not exist. Each is styled by its class and its position rather than its number, so nothing changes on screen.","value":"2 headings"}],"mechanical":["empty paragraphs removed: 2","drupal entity attrs stripped: 115","redundant bold inside a heading removed: 1","action links marked: 17"],"findings":[],"safe":true,"audit":{"alias":"/schools/eut/polices/employees","title":"EUT Policies for Teachers and Staff","changed":"2026-04-06T22:55:15+00:00","words":165,"bytes":13229,"fixes":["empty paragraphs removed: 2","drupal entity attrs stripped: 115","redundant bold inside a heading removed: 1","action links marked: 17"],"flags":["no section-header device"],"contentSafe":true,"headings":[{"l":4,"t":"Contact","bh":false},{"l":6,"t":"Richard Colpitts Director of State Schools Phone: 207-624-6895 / 207-557-2527 (Cell) Email","bh":false}],"outline":[{"i":0,"issue":"jumps h1 to h4","text":"Contact"},{"i":1,"issue":"jumps h4 to h6","text":"Richard Colpitts Director of State Schools Phone: 207-624-6895 / 207-557-2527 (Cell) Email"}],"components":{"cards":0,"